{"title":"Bogling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 25 Bog that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 67 times (1.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>168</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>148</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>153</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>177</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>39</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>168</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>26</b></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>148</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>153</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>177</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>39</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"bogling\" data-map-level=\"26\">Show level 26 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/26b781549a47239e8218.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/c6b79e29faf1f957b127.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/0510dbf5ad7b395e4494.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 20 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 20 looted corpses, 29 recorded drops, 1,049 total, 13–101 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/20</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mire-essence\" title=\"Mire Essence - in 55% of 20 looted corpses, 11 recorded drops, 14 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/284aeada05ba452c76f1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mire Essence</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">55% · 11/20</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"peat-clod\" title=\"Peat Clod - in 50% of 20 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 17 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f756d6ee3fa57e31c8db.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Peat Clod</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 10/20</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bog-pelt\" title=\"Bog Pelt - in 50% of 20 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 16 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/851eda3e442f3ed8925d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bog Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 10/20</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 10% of 20 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 13 total, 5–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">10% · 2/20</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-ex