8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 437 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 82 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 16 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1436, 67 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"bogling\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bog: <a href=\"#/monster/bog\">Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-bog\">Elder Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mire-bog\">Mire Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ancient-bog\">Ancient Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/26b781549a47239e8218.webp\" alt=\"Bogling\"></div><h3>Bogling</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>26</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 25)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bog</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>94</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>18.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,300</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></t